OL,9,G0532FInheritance: Samsung
OL,10,     GSamsung finds global recognition
OL,11,     Gthrough a relentless focus on
OL,12,     Gquality and some help from
OL,13,     GHollywood. But in the mid-2000s,
OL,14,     Gits leaders come under pressure
OL,15,     Gabout alleged bribery.
